This program runs the Inworld Voice Isolator (v1, offline checkpoint):
  https://huggingface.co/inworld/voice-isolator
  https://github.com/inworld-ai/voice-isolator
  Copyright 2026 Inworld AI, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

src/model.rs, src/gpu.rs, src/kernels.rs and src/config.rs are independent Rust
re-implementations of the network defined in that project's model.py, scan.py
and isolator.py (inference only), and were checked against its published golden
fixtures. The model weights are not included in this repository or in the
release binaries; they are downloaded from Hugging Face on first run and
verified by SHA-256.

The golden test (tests/golden.py) downloads audio fixtures derived from
LibriSpeech (CC BY 4.0, (c) 2014 Vassil Panayotov); they are not redistributed.
